---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'; import FactBoundary from '../../components/FactBoundary.astro'; import { work } from '../../data/content';
export function getStaticPaths(){ return [{params:{slug:work.slug}}]; }
---
<Layout title={`${work.title}｜小民艺术`} description={work.summary}><section class="container work-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Work 001 / 首款作品</span><h1 class="serif">{work.title}</h1><p lang="en" class="muted">{work.en}</p><span class="concept">概念与样品阶段 · 非量产实物</span></div><img src="/assets/images/placeholder.svg" alt="四季福愿 · 心事成字的作品方向概念图，展示东方书写与空间陈设方向" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="1043" /></section><section class="container"><FactBoundary /></section><section class="container section chapters"><div class="chapter"><span class="mono">01</span><div><h2 class="serif">命名缘起</h2><p>“四季福愿”是一个内容方向：从一年四季的日常出发，选择一个祝愿，把一句心事交给小民。“心事成字”是先听后写的方法，而不是对结果的保证。</p></div></div><div class="chapter"><span class="mono">02</span><div><h2 class="serif">材料与工艺</h2><p>当前方向为卷轴或无玻璃轻装裱。具体纸材、尺寸、墨、印章、装裱和包装，会在真实打样后随项目说明公开。</p></div></div><div class="chapter"><span class="mono">03</span><div><h2 class="serif">人的场景</h2><p>可以写给家人、伴侣、师长，也可以写给正在重新开始的自己。适合礼赠、家居与自我祝愿等场景。</p></div></div><div class="chapter"><span class="mono">04</span><div><h2 class="serif">拥有与传递</h2><p>作品可能成为一段关系的纪念物。编号、创作视频、双语故事卡和手写回应，只有在实际能力确认后才会成为确定交付。</p></div></div></section><section class="container section details"><div><span class="eyebrow">Delivery notes / 交付说明</span><h2 class="serif">交付清单与规格</h2></div><dl><dt>状态</dt><dd>概念 / 样品阶段</dd><dt>交付类型</dt><dd>原创真迹（以项目说明为准）</dd><dt>材质</dt><dd class="pending">打样后随项目说明公开</dd><dt>尺寸</dt><dd class="pending">打样后随项目说明公开</dd><dt>价格 / 交期</dt><dd class="pending">以项目说明为准</dd></dl><a class="btn btn-primary" href={`/custom-commission/?inspiration=${encodeURIComponent(work.title)}`}>开启定制咨询 <span>→</span></a></section></Layout>
<style>.work-hero{padding:96px 0 64px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:64px}.work-hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,6vw,76px);line-height:1.15;margin:20px 0}.work-hero img{width:100%;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.chapters{max-width:820px}.chapter{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr;gap:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:28px 0}.chapter:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.chapter .mono{color:var(--accent)}.chapter h2{font-size:34px;margin:0 0 10px}.chapter p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}.details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}.details h2{font-size:38px;margin-top:18px}.details dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.details dt,.details dd{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0;margin:0;font-size:14px}.details dd{color:var(--muted)}.details .btn{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}@media(max-width:767px){.work-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:56px 0 40px;gap:28px}.chapter{grid-template-columns:38px 1fr;gap:8px}.chapter h2{font-size:30px}.details{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.details .btn{grid-column:1}}
</style>
